@startuml Recommendation Algorithm Flow

!theme plain
title Luồng thuật toán khuyến nghị Pet Shop

start

:User request recommendations;

:Analyze user preferences from:
- Orders (priority: 5.0)
- Favorites (priority: 3.0) 
- Search history (priority: 1.5)
- Viewed pets (priority: 1.0);

if (User has preferences?) then (yes)
    :Calculate dynamic thresholds:
    - Top breed score × 60%
    - Select max 5 qualified breeds;
    
    :PHASE 1: Breed-specific targeting;
    
    :For each qualified breed:
    - Query pets by exact breed
    - Score: 0.85-0.95 (very high)
    - Reason: "Phù hợp với sở thích về [breed]";
    
    if (Found ≥ 2 good breed matches?) then (no)
        :PHASE 2: Category-level fallback;
        
        :For preferred categories:
        - Query pets by category
        - Score: 0.45-0.65 (medium)
        - Reason: "Khám phá thêm trong danh mục [category]";
    endif
    
else (no)
    :Use general recommendations;
endif

if (Need more recommendations?) then (yes)
    :PHASE 3: General discovery;
    
    :Query diverse categories:
    - Dogs, Cats, Birds, Fish
    - Score: 0.6 (good)
    - Reason: "Khám phá thú cưng mới";
endif

:Remove duplicates and limit results;

partition "Parallel Algorithm Execution" {
    :Content-Based Filtering\n(Weight: 40%);
    :Collaborative Filtering\n(Weight: 30%);
    :Trending Analysis\n(Weight: 20%);
    :Association Rules\n(Weight: 10%);
}

:Hybrid Combination:
- Weighted score calculation
- Duplicate removal
- Score normalization;

:Final ranking by combined score;

:Cache results for 1 hour;

:Return recommendations to user;

stop

note right
    **Scoring System:**
    • Purchase: 5.0
    • Favorite: 3.0  
    • Search: 1.5
    • View: 1.0
    
    **Recency Multipliers:**
    • 0-30 days: 2.0×
    • 30-90 days: 1.5×
    • >90 days: 1.0×
end note

@enduml